#. Translators: An option in an action definition combobox Character Information setting panel.
#: addon\globalPlugins\charInfo\ciGui.py:24
msgid "Report the character"
msgstr "Anunciar el carácter"

#. Translators: An option in an action definition combobox Character Information setting panel.
#: addon\globalPlugins\charInfo\ciGui.py:26
